      <title>Bringing AI to the next generation of fusion energy</title>
      <link>https://deepmind.google/discover/blog/bringing-ai-to-the-next-generation-of-fusion-energy/</link>
      <description>&lt;div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin: 8px 0; background-color: #f9f9f9;"&gt;
&lt;div style="font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 8px;"&gt;
📄 Source: Google DeepMind Blog
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 8px;"&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #7f8c8d;"&gt;👤 Author: DeepMind&lt;/span&gt; | &lt;span style="color: #7f8c8d;"&gt;📅 Date: 2023-11-14&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 8px;"&gt;
&lt;span style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.8em;"&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.8em;"&gt;Fusion Energy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="background-color: #3498db; color: white; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.8em;"&gt;Plasma Physics&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="line-height: 1.6;"&gt;
DeepMind is collaborating with the UK Atomic Energy Authority to apply advanced AI techniques, including reinforcement learning, to improve plasma control in fusion reactors. This AI-driven approach enhances magnetic confinement and plasma stability in tokamak devices, accelerating fusion research and bringing us closer to sustainable fusion energy. The initiative is part of a broader effort to use AI for scientific discovery across multiple fields.
&lt;/div&gt;</description>
